      "modalClose": "Close",

      "whatTitle": "What is Continuum?",
      "whatBody": "Continuum is a personalized learning platform for students of technical specialties. It brings together learning materials, practical tasks, notes, progress analytics and social interaction in one interface — no more switching between dozens of services.\n\nA focus room with a Pomodoro timer, recommendations based on your weak topics, a leaderboard and a community feed — all free, via one Google account.",

      "supportTitle": "Support",
      "supportBody": "If something is broken or you have a question — reach out. We respond within 1–2 business days.\n\nEmail: support@continuum.study\n\nFrequently asked questions:\n• How do I sign in? — Click «Continue with Google» and choose your account.\n• Can I use a university account? — Yes, any Google account works.\n• Where is my data stored? — In Supabase's secure cloud (EU region).",

      "termsTitle": "Terms of Use",
      "termsBody": "By using the Continuum platform, you agree to the following terms:\n\n1. The platform is provided for educational purposes. Distribution of harmful or illegal content is prohibited.\n\n2. Your account is linked to your Google account. Keeping it secure is your responsibility.\n\n3. We may change platform functionality, notifying you of significant changes through the interface.\n\n4. Content you post in the community remains yours, but you grant us a license to display it within the platform.\n\n5. The platform may be temporarily unavailable for maintenance.",

      "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
      "privacyBody": "We collect only the minimum data needed to operate the platform:\n\n• Name and email — from your Google account, for profile display.\n• Learning progress — task results, notes, focus sessions.\n• Technical data — interface language, activity timestamps.\n\nWe do not sell your data to third parties or use it for targeted advertising. Data is stored on Supabase's secure servers in the European Union.\n\nYou can request deletion of your account and all associated data by emailing support@continuum.study."
    }
